    {
      "index": 3,
      "mapName": "DragonSlayer01.h3m",
      "regionText": "You face the last challenge in becoming a Dragon Slayer.  You must complete the test course in six months or fail the test.  The Crystal Dragons will be well guarded, the paths watched by other creations.  Golems, Gargoyles and Elementals will try and stop you before you can kill the Crystal Dragon.",
      "prologText": "My mother has finished preperations for my final test.  The finest crystal, stealthly taken from the caverns of Krewlod, has been used to create a great dragon golem.   This creature's construction is a feat of magical prowess.  To destroy it... is an even greater feat.  Yet, I have heard the greatest feat a dragon slayer can accomplish is to kill the rare a mighty Azure Dragon.",
